  "description": "Event-sourced durable entities for Akka.NET: describe an entity with Decide and Evolve functions, and Akka.Durable persists, recovers and hosts it locally or in Akka.Cluster.Sharding, with typed entity references, durable reminders and Akka.Hosting integration.",
